---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Container from '../components/Container.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'October 2, 2026';
const number = '(279) 205-7034';
const numberHref = 'sms:+12792057034';
---

<Layout
  title="Zugabot Text Alerts — Zuga Technologies"
  description="How to opt in to Zugabot Text Alerts: account alerts sent by text message to the owner of a Zugabot account."
>
  <article class="py-section">
    <Container width="narrow">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink-100 sm:text-4xl">Zugabot Text Alerts</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-ink-300 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Zugabot is the AI assistant built by Zuga Technologies. Zugabot Text Alerts sends the owner of a Zugabot account short text messages about their own account: system alerts (a job failed, a spending limit was reached), goal and job updates, and replies when the owner texts Zugabot a question.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-100">How to opt in</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Text <strong class="text-ink-100">START</strong> to <a href={numberHref} class="text-accent-500 hover:text-accent-400">{number}</a> from your mobile phone. You will receive one confirmation:
          </p>
          <blockquote class="mt-3 border-l-2 border-rule pl-4 text-ink-400">
            Zugabot: You're subscribed to Zugabot Text Alerts. Msg frequency varies (up to 10/day). Msg &amp; data rates may apply. Reply HELP for help, STOP to cancel.
          </blockquote>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-100">Program details</h2>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li><strong class="text-ink-200">Who receives them:</strong> only the person who owns the Zugabot account and opts in. No marketing messages are sent.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink-200">How often:</strong> message frequency varies, up to 10 messages per day.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink-200">Cost:</strong> Message and data rates may apply.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink-200">Opt out:</strong> reply <strong class="text-ink-100">STOP</strong> at any time. You will get one final confirmation and no further messages.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-ink-200">Help:</strong> reply <strong class="text-ink-100">HELP</strong>, or email <a href="mailto:buga@zugabot.ai" class="text-accent-500 hover:text-accent-400">buga@zugabot.ai</a>.</li>
            <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-100">Privacy</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Your mobile number is used only to send these alerts. We do not share, sell, or provide your mobile phone number or messaging consent data to third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. See our <a href="/privacy" class="text-accent-500 hover:text-accent-400">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms#sms" class="text-accent-500 hover:text-accent-400">Terms</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </article>
</Layout>
